# Wan Shi Tong, All-Knowing's "whenever one or more cards are put into a library from anywhere" looks back in time when the
# card was one all players could see (CR 603.10a: an object put into a hand or library from a public zone), so Wan Shi
# Tong putting itself into its library with its own enters ability sees its own move: the trigger is judged on the board
# as it was before, Wan Shi Tong on it. Its owner tucks it second from the top and gets two 1/1 Spirits.

